\section{Sentiment Analysis}

In sentiment analysis, the goal is to identify an opinion, emotion, or attitude in written or spoken text. This can be used to understand the attitude of users on social media, for example.

\subsection{Task}

We'll use a dataset from Kaggle for this task. The task is to assign the sentiment of a movie review.
